<dict><key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string><key>label</key><string>启用夜间分时充电计划</string><key>key</key><string>chargeScheduleEnabled</string><key>default</key><false/><key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string><key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string><key>footerText</key><string>不需要同时开启“普通充电上限”；开启后夜间计划优先执行。</string></dict>
<dict><key>cell</key><string>PSTitleValueCell</string><key>action</key><string>selectScheduleValue:</string><key>label</key><string>第一阶段开始（目标70%）</string><key>key</key><string>chargeScheduleStartHour</string><key>default</key><integer>22</integer><key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string><key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string></dict>
<dict><key>cell</key><string>PSTitleValueCell</string><key>action</key><string>selectScheduleValue:</string><key>label</key><string>第二阶段开始（目标85%）</string><key>key</key><string>chargeScheduleStage2Hour</string><key>default</key><integer>5</integer><key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string><key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string></dict>
<dict><key>cell</key><string>PSTitleValueCell</string><key>action</key><string>selectScheduleValue:</string><key>label</key><string>最终充满开始（目标100%）</string><key>key</key><string>chargeScheduleStage3Hour</string><key>default</key><integer>6</integer><key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string><key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string></dict>
<dict><key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string><key>label</key><string>智能温度停充</string><key>footerText</key><string>开启后，电池温度达到上限时使用阻止充电（CH0C）暂停充电；降到下限后自动恢复。它独立于系统温控，不修改 CPU 温控策略。</string></dict>
<dict><key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string><key>label</key><string>启用智能温度停充</string><key>key</key><string>smartThermalChargeEnable</string><key>default</key><false/><key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string><key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string></dict>
